{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T20:50:47",
      "utterance": "（今晩は。宜しくお願い致します。）",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T20:51:03",
      "utterance": "（よろしくお願い致します。）",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:00:07",
      "utterance": "こんばんは。相談員です。来ていただき、ありがとうございます。最初に、年齢・性別・ご相談内容を教えていただけますか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:00:36",
      "utterance": "16歳　女性",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:00:52",
      "utterance": "眠れない　食べれない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:01:18",
      "utterance": "教えていただき、ありがとうございます。そうでしたか。そのことで悩んでいらしたのですね?",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:01:21",
      "utterance": "眠れる方法知りたい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:01:57",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。いろいろくわしく教えてくださいね。",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:02:06",
      "utterance": "何を？",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:02:19",
      "utterance": "私が知りたいです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:03:04",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。もう少しお話お聞かせくださいね。いつ頃から、そのようになったのでしょう?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:03:35",
      "utterance": "眠れないのはけっこう前から",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:03:45",
      "utterance": "食べれないのは最近",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:04:16",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか。そのような状態で、来ていただいたのですね。お辛いですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:04:32",
      "utterance": "何か、きっかけのようなものがありました?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:04:49",
      "utterance": "親が離婚して",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:05:02",
      "utterance": "母が出ていきました",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:05:14",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか…。その頃からなのですね。",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:05:17",
      "utterance": "もう無理",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:05:28",
      "utterance": "生きてたくない",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:06:02",
      "utterance": "そのように苦しいのですね。お母様が出ていかれてから、ご飯とかはどうしているのですか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:06:46",
      "utterance": "各自",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:07:33",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか、大変ですよね。ご兄弟がいらっしゃるのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:07:58",
      "utterance": "いますけど",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:08:32",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。生活費とかははどうされているのでしょうか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:08:57",
      "utterance": "それ聞いて眠れるようになりますか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:09:34",
      "utterance": "相談者様がどのように生活されているのか、心配です。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:09:48",
      "utterance": "普通に暮らしてる",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:10:15",
      "utterance": "お母様が出ていかれてから、生活がだいぶかわられたのでしょうか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:10:36",
      "utterance": "だから普通",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:11:08",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。お母様が出ていらした時って、どんなお気持ちだったのでしよう?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:11:23",
      "utterance": "だから死にたい",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:11:37",
      "utterance": "生きてたくない",
      "distress_level": 3,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:11:54",
      "utterance": "そのように思われるほど、ショックだったのですね…。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:12:33",
      "utterance": "最近、眠れなくなった、とのことですが、同じようなことが原因でしょうか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:12:56",
      "utterance": "眠れないのはその前から",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:13:21",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。何か出来事とか、ありました?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:13:21",
      "utterance": "睡眠障害だから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:13:53",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか…。ずいぶん長く続いているのですか?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:14:21",
      "utterance": "一度病院で言われて",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:14:44",
      "utterance": "でも先生と合わなくて",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:14:55",
      "utterance": "今は行ってない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:15:40",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。何もお薬とか飲んでいないのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:15:50",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:16:30",
      "utterance": "夜は何時間ぐらいねむれているのでしょう?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:16:56",
      "utterance": "それ聞いたら眠れるようになりますか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:17:45",
      "utterance": "睡眠障害とのことですが、どのくらい眠れないのかなと思いました。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:18:21",
      "utterance": "アロマ炊いたり",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:18:35",
      "utterance": "音楽きいたり",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:18:42",
      "utterance": "いろいろしたけど無理",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:19:27",
      "utterance": "そうだったのですね。打ちひしがれてしまいますよね。それでは学校に行ったとき、すごく眠くなるのでしょうね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:20:41",
      "utterance": "眠れないなって思うと、どんなお気持ちになるのでしょう?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:21:26",
      "utterance": "困る",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:22:07",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。寝たいのに眠れない、すごく辛いですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:22:20",
      "utterance": "まあ、はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:23:30",
      "utterance": "その分、他の時間で眠くなったりします?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:24:10",
      "utterance": "特にはない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:24:44",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。それでは体が疲れてしまいますよね。学校には行けてます?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:25:03",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:25:54",
      "utterance": "頑張り屋さんなのですね。ご飯も食べれない、とのことですが、少しは食べれるのですか?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:26:23",
      "utterance": "お弁当だけ",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:26:26",
      "utterance": "昼の",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:27:00",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか、それでは全然足りないですよね。相談者様のこのような状態について、お父様は何かおっしゃいます?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:27:17",
      "utterance": "あんまり話さないから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:27:23",
      "utterance": "忙しいし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:27:45",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか。寂しいですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:28:07",
      "utterance": "別に、みんなバラバラだし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:28:48",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。お母様がいらした時は、普通に食べれていたのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:29:12",
      "utterance": "普通って何ですか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:29:40",
      "utterance": "分かりにくい言い方で、すみません。",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:30:17",
      "utterance": "いえ",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:30:19",
      "utterance": "朝と晩はご飯を食べていらしたのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:32:17",
      "utterance": "答えたくなければ答えなくていいですよ。昼のお弁当は、コンビニとかで買うのでしょうか?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:32:47",
      "utterance": "作る時も買う時もあり",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:32:50",
      "utterance": "ある",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:33:45",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。ご自身で作っていらして。すごいことですね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:34:55",
      "utterance": "そんなことない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:35:17",
      "utterance": "朝とか夜のご飯は、買ったり、作ろう、とは思わないのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:35:56",
      "utterance": "？？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:36:49",
      "utterance": "また、分かりづらいですね。学校で、クラスメートと一緒に食べるお弁当は、たべられるのですね?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:37:16",
      "utterance": "それ聞いてどうするんですか",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:38:30",
      "utterance": "相談者様にとって、食べる空間って、一人では食欲がわかないのかな、と思いました。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:40:23",
      "utterance": "眠れなかったり、食べれなかったりが続いて…。体調の方はどうですか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:42:10",
      "utterance": "眠れるようになるにはどうしたらいいか教えてください",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:43:39",
      "utterance": "そのように思われるのですね。睡眠障害…、との診断が出ているのであれば、思春期外来の別の専門病院を考えましたが…。",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:44:41",
      "utterance": "でも、薬を使わずに眠りたいのでしょうね。お母様がいらした時の、楽しかった思い出を思い出してみるのは、どうでしよう?",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:45:04",
      "utterance": "病院お金かかるから行きにくいし",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:45:35",
      "utterance": "もういいです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:46:15",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。眠る時も、緊張していらっしゃるのもあるのでしようか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:46:39",
      "utterance": "？？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:47:13",
      "utterance": "いろいろとリラックスできるように、試してみたんですものね。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:49:11",
      "utterance": "眠ろうとする時って、何かg気がかりなこととか、嫌な思い出とか出て来ます?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:50:00",
      "utterance": "（gは余計でした）",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:50:16",
      "utterance": "よくわからない",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:51:35",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。相談者の眠りを妨げようとする、何か原因があるのかもしれませんね。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:53:14",
      "utterance": "先生と合わなくて…、とのことですが、何か言われたり、とかて゛しようか?",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:54:46",
      "utterance": "一方的だったから",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:55:18",
      "utterance": "そうなのですね。相談者のお気持ちを聴いてもらいたかった感じでしょうか?",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:55:39",
      "utterance": "？？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:56:36",
      "utterance": "失礼しました、相談者様の、でした。何か押し付けられるような感じだったのでしょうか?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:58:17",
      "utterance": "病院に通っていらした時は眠れていたのでしようか?",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2024-06-12T21:58:48",
      "utterance": "眠れないから病院行きました",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
